    "detail": {
      "id": 1360106,
      "name": "[Stun: Knock] Spectral Pierce",
      "desc": "<color=#FFFFFF>Auxiliary Assist</color>: Trigger accumulates Energy over time, starting with 75 Charge. With enough Energy, press Auxiliary Assist to summon Trigger and launch an <color=#FFFFFF>Auxiliary Assist</color> attack on enemies. Hitting an enemy inflicts the <color=#FFFFFF>Pierce</color> effect. Enemies with the <color=#FFFFFF>Pierce</color> effect have their <color=#2BAD00>Stun DMG Multiplier increased by 20%</color>. The <color=#FFFFFF>Pierce</color> effect ends when the enemies recover from the Stunned state. When Trigger's <color=#FFFFFF>Auxiliary Assist</color> hits a normal enemy, elite enemy, or boss enemy, it <color=#2BAD00>accumulates 100%/30%/15% Stun</color>.",
